msgid ""
"❝ The WHO Barcelona Office is a centre of excellence in health financing "
"for universal health coverage ❞"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The WHO Barcelona Office is a centre of excellence in health financing for "
"universal health coverage. It works with Member State across WHO's European "
"Region to promote evidence-informed policy making"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A key part of the work of the Office is to assess country and regional "
"progress towards universal health coverage by monitoring financial "
"protection - the impact of out-of-pocket payments for health on living "
"standards and proverty. Financial protection is a core dimension of health "
"system performance and an indicator for the Sustainable Development Goals."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Office supports countries to develop policy, monitor progress and "
"design reforms through health system problem diagnosis, analysis of "
"country-specific policy options, high-level policy dialogue and the sharing "
"of international experience. It is also the home for WHO training courses "
"on health financing and health systems strengthening for the better health "
"outcomes."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Established in 1999, the Office is supported by the Government of the "
"Autonomous Community of Catalonia, Spain. It is part of the Division of "
"Country Health Policies and Systems of the WHO Region Office for Europe."
msgstr ""

